<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Oil and Gas sets option exercise price.</title>
<headline>NZ Oil and Gas sets option exercise price.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand Oil and Gas on Friday set the option exercise price for its one-for-two bonus issue at NZ$0.70.</p>
<p>The company announced the issue of free share options to shareholders, in the ratio of one option for each two shares held, on October 16.</p>
<p>The options will be exercisable on July 1, 1998, and until October 31, 2001.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
